49:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Customer Churn Prediction"}],": A SaaS company uses Logistic Regression to predict which customers are most likely to cancel their subscriptions. The algorithm analyzes customer usage patterns, support ticket history, and engagement metrics to assign each customer a \"churn probability score\" between 0% and 100%. Leadership can then prioritize retention efforts on customers with high churn probabilities."]}]
