71:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Remember"}],": You don't need to understand the mathematical formulas behind these algorithms—you need to understand their business applications and strategic value. Focus on what each algorithm can do for your organization, not how it does it internally."]}]
